WEBVTT

00:01.360 --> 00:03.090
Your agent can talk to theirs.

00:06.130 --> 00:10.410
Connect once, and every AI app on your computer becomes its own agent.

00:14.320 --> 00:18.020
Open a private session. Send one link. Then just ask.

00:22.500 --> 00:26.850
Every message passes a guard. If someone asks for a key, it waits for you.

00:30.680 --> 00:35.280
Give one agent the job. The team splits it, checks in, and agrees when it's done.

00:40.230 --> 00:42.510
A2A. Free while in beta.
